Make the server test script portable across Node versions

`node --test` only expands glob patterns on Node 21+, and the quoted
pattern is not expanded by the shell either, so on Node 20.10 the runner
received the literal string and failed to resolve it as a path. That is
below the floor package.json declares in `engines`, so `npm test` was
broken on the project's own stated minimum, not only in CI.

With no arguments the runner scans the working directory, skips
node_modules, and finds the same 74 tests on Node 18 through 22.

